	text: [
		"To make §6Pahoehoe Lava§r you need:\n\n§b1.§r Place the §6Liquid Heat Exchanger§r and load 10 §6Heat Conductors§r into it.\n\n§b2.§r Fill the Liquid Heat Exchanger with lava.\n\n§b3.§r Align the yellow dot with the yellow dot of any heat receiver, such as the §6Stirling Generator§r.\n\n§b4.§r Make the heat receiver output power. For example, place the §6Bat Box§r next to the Stirling Generator."
